**Production User Provisioning: Secure SFTP Environment Creation for External File Exchange**

## Overview

A production request was received to provision a secure SFTP environment for an external customer (**MERIDA**) on the backup server. The requirement 
included creating a dedicated SFTP directory, provisioning a restricted user account, assigning secure permissions, and validating secure file 
transfer operations.

The SFTP environment was successfully configured following Linux security best practices, and end-to-end validation was performed by uploading and 
downloading test files to ensure the customer could securely exchange data.

