## Key Learning

Provisioning a secure SFTP environment involves more than creating a user account. Proper directory ownership, permission management, secure 
password policies, and end-to-end validation are essential to ensure reliable and secure file exchange. Verifying both upload and download operations
before handover helps identify permission or configuration issues early and ensures a smooth customer onboarding experience.

